{
  "bookId": "hero-211203",
  "id": "bond-28511",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28511001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，我说……这是怎么回事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "惊喜吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "比起惊喜，更多应该是惊吓吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你要我去帮你解决什么仇人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为什么会这么想？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这么夸张的房子，肯定要花不少钱吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不用想也是一份大单。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是送你的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "又是这种让人难以相信的说辞吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果硬要说委托的话，其实也不是完全没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哈，我就知道，说说你的要求，我心情不错，可以帮你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "委托内容的话，就是请好好使用它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "里面准备了很多有趣的赛道，我想你应该会喜欢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……你这家伙，果然是喜欢我吧？？想用这房子钓我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28511015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "小心我让你血本无归！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
